  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3IE-To Promote More Rigorous and Systematic Assessment of the Impact of Development Policies and Programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment in impact evaluation is part of DFID&apos;s overall strategy on results to strengthen independent evaluation and stimulate the production of public goods inherent to impact evaluation studies. There are potentially strong links in how we do this to DFID&apos;s work in Africa and Research programmes</narrative>
  </description>
